        <item>
            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string>Submit a dialog-based action (e.g. Create Related Payment, Create Reversal).\n
\n
    Handles the ERP5 dialog pattern: fetches the dialog form, collects field\n
    defaults, applies user overrides, and POSTs to execute the action.\n
    Returns the result (new document URL, status message, or dialog fields).\n
\n
    USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - You need to execute a dialog action from erp5_read\'s \'actions\' array.\n
    - Common actions: \'create_related_payment\', \'create_reversal\',\n
      \'apply_trade_condition\', \'add_sale_invoice_transaction_line\'.\n
\n
    DO NOT USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - You want to trigger a workflow transition — use erp5_action instead.\n
    - You want to download/print — use erp5_download instead.\n
    - You want to edit fields — use erp5_write instead.\n
\n
    PREREQUISITE: Call erp5_read first — the \'actions\' array lists available\n
    dialog actions with their \'name\' values.\n
    </string> </value>
